---
import LegalLayout from "@/layouts/legal-layout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Docita collects, uses, and safeguards personal and healthcare-related data."
  lastUpdated="November 26, 2025"
>
  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">1. Introduction</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Docita is committed to protecting personal and healthcare-related data.
      This policy explains what information we collect, why we collect it, and
      how we use and secure it when you use our clinic management services.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">2. Information We Collect</h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>Account information such as name, email, phone, and clinic details.</li>
      <li>Operational clinic data such as appointments, prescriptions, and billing records.</li>
      <li>Usage and technical data required to keep the service reliable and secure.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">3. How We Use Data</h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>To deliver core product functionality and customer support.</li>
      <li>To maintain system performance, security, and abuse prevention.</li>
      <li>To comply with applicable healthcare and data-protection obligations.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">4. Security and Retention</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      We use layered security controls such as access restrictions, encrypted
      transport, and infrastructure safeguards. Data retention follows legal,
      operational, and compliance obligations relevant to healthcare workflows.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">5. Data Sharing</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      We do not sell personal data. Data may be shared with processors who help
      us operate the service, or when legally required. We require appropriate
      contractual and security controls for such processing.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">6. Your Rights</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Depending on jurisdiction, you may request access, correction, deletion,
      or portability of personal data. To raise a request, contact
      <a class="ml-1 text-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:admin@docita.work">admin@docita.work</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
